# FlatBuffers runtime headers

Version: 25.9.23
Upstream: https://github.com/google/flatbuffers/tree/v25.9.23
License: Apache-2.0 (see `LICENSE`)

The C++ runtime headers under `include/flatbuffers` are copied without local
modification from the official release. They match:

- `flatc` 25.9.23 used by `tools/generate-denial-wire`
- Dart package `flat_buffers` 25.9.23 pinned in `dart_shell/pubspec.yaml`

Normal builds consume these checked-in headers and generated protocol files.
They do not download FlatBuffers and do not invoke `flatc`.
